      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This talk is about maintaining (or trying to maintain) big databases with large tables with a minimum of downtime and the tools helping for those tasks.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Configure ibdata&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt; Backup ?&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt; Clean the data (optimize and archiving)&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt; Status of long queries in realtime&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;A short overview of innotop, maatkit, ptxarchiver, ...&#xA;&#xA;  </description>
